\chapter{Architectural Blueprint}
\cleardoublepage

\section{System Overview}
WAuth implements a layered architecture with clear separation of concerns across five primary components:

\begin{enumerate}
	\item \textbf{Application Layer}: WAuth class and functional API
	\item \textbf{Driver Layer}: LocalDriver and DockerDriver with factory selection
	\item \textbf{Crypto Layer}: CryptoEngine for encryption/decryption
	\item \textbf{Storage Layer}: Vault backed by SQLite via wsqlite
	\item \textbf{Model Layer}: SecretModel (Pydantic) for data validation
\end{enumerate}

